msgid "myTannwald is a customer portal for a fictional Swiss machine builder. Customers see only the documents of their own machines. An assistant answers exclusively from approved documents and names its source. Editorial and compliance approve. Drupal 11, hybrid search, Qwen via API — built as a proof of concept."
